OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALFB demonstrates terror response
OL,4,Aafter arson attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) has
OL,7,Fdemonstrated how it would respond to a
OL,8,Fmarauding terrorist attack, months
OL,9,Fafter four Jewish community ambulances
OL,10,Fwere set alight in Golders Green.
OL,12,FMembers of the London Assembly Fire
OL,13,FCommittee visited Finchley Fire Station
OL,14,Ffor an update on the emergency
OL,15,Fresponse, and to see how crews would
OL,16,Fdeal with a similar incident.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1788281766
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALFB demonstrates terror response
OL,4,Aafter arson attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave Rich, director of policy at the
OL,7,FCommunity Security Trust, which advises
OL,8,Fon security across the Jewish
OL,9,Fcommunity, said: "Unfortunately the way
OL,10,Fthings are we have to prepare for the
OL,11,Fpossibility of future attacks."
OL,13,FLFB borough commander Rob Davis
OL,14,Fdescribed the capital as "a forever
OL,15,Fchanging environment", which faced "new
OL,16,Fmethods of attacks".
